  "description": "🎨 Text Color Console Package\n\nTired of plain Console.WriteLine outputs?\nWith this lightweight package, you can easily print text in 16 different colors with just a single command.\n\n✅ Simple\n✅ Lightweight\n✅ Practical\n\n🚀 Usage\n\nInstead of writing:\nConsole.Write(\"hello world\");\n\nJust write:\nText.Green(\"hello world\");\n\nIt works just like Console.WriteLine();, meaning you can pass any variable type, and it also supports various formatting options.\n\n🎨 Available Colors\n\nRed\n\nGreen\n\nYellow\n\nBlue\n\nCyan\n\nWhite\n\nBlack\n\nGray\n\nMagenta\n\nDarkRed\n\nDarkYellow\n\nDarkBlue\n\nDarkGray\n\nDarkGreen\n\nDarkCyan\n\nDarkMagenta\n\n⚡ A simple but powerful package for colorful console applications!",
